OL,4,BJoint-record six referee errors in     
OL,5,Blast Premier League weekend            
OL,6,GThe Premier League's Key Match         
OL,7,GIncidents Panel has ruled there were   
OL,8,Gsix on-field errors in the last round  
OL,9,Gof games - the joint-highest it has    
OL,10,Grecorded in one weekend.               
OL,12,FEach week, the five members of the     
OL,13,Fpanel assess all the contentious       
OL,14,Fincidents and vote whether both the    
OL,15,Freferee and the video assistant        
OL,16,Freferee (VAR) have got the decisions   
OL,17,Fcorrect.                               
OL,19,FYou have to go back to the early part  
OL,20,Fof the 2023-24 season to find the last 
OL,21,Ftime there were six mistakes logged.   
